<title>AUSTRALIA: RALLYING-AUSTRALIA RALLY LEADING POSITIONS.</title>
<headline>RALLYING-AUSTRALIA RALLY LEADING POSITIONS.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH, Australia 1996-09-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading positions after</p>
<p>Sunday's six special stages on the second day of the Rally of</p>
<p>Australia:</p>
<p>1. Tommi Makinen (Finland) Mitsubishi Lancer  3 hours 06</p>
<p>minutes 00 seconds</p>
